# Local development

## Daily (one command)

```bash
npm run dev   # API :3401 + web :5401 (aggregated logs via concurrently)
```

| Command | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `npm run dev` | Both packages with prefixed watch logs |
| `npm run dev:api` | NestJS watch only (`:3401`) |
| `npm run dev:web` | Vite only (`:5401`) |
| `npm test` / `npm run test:cov` | Unit tests (+ coverage) |
| `npm run build` | Build api + web |

Open **http://localhost:5401**.

## Ports

| Port | Service |
|---|---|
| 3401 | Nest API |
| 5401 | Vue (Vite); proxies `/api` → `http://localhost:3401` |

Avoid `3000` / `5173` / `5174`.

## Resolved gotchas

| Symptom | Fix |
|---|---|
| API fails to bind / wrong app on port | Confirm `api/src/main.ts` uses `3401`, not `3000` |
| `/api/qr/generate` 404 from the browser | Vite must proxy `/api` → `:3401`; restart `npm run dev:web` after `vite.config.ts` changes |
| UI works but API is down | Expected today — generation is browser-side; API only needed for server endpoint testing |
| Coverage / tests fail after moving QR logic | Put pure logic in `web/src/lib/qr.ts` and keep specs beside it |

## Prerequisites

Node 20+ (repo developed on Node 24), npm. Optional: [GitHub CLI](https://cli.github.com/) (`gh`) for `/create-github-pr`.
